{"4218230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spring Me Up", "steam_appid": 4218230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPRING YOUR WAY UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...through a colossal, punishing world, using nothing but a giant spring strapped to your body. Every jump demands perfect compression, careful angles, and ruthless precision if you want to reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/942cda03c40245f4bd07f419524ab34a.poster.avif?t=1771851892\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/942cda03c40245f4bd07f419524ab34a.webm?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/942cda03c40245f4bd07f419524ab34a.mp4?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...takes you through a vast of punishing levels, filled with diverse environments, tricky platforms, and unexpected surprises. Every jump matters, and the path to the top is full of tension, testing your patience, skill, and self-control. Will you reach the ultimate success, or stumble just short and face a different fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/14ad4874e0a92ccccd203ea6d14de39a.avif?t=1771851892\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras_big/14ad4874e0a92ccccd203ea6d14de39a.avif?t=1771851892 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ENJOY:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deaths, just pain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the constant fear of falling and losing all your progress. Perhaps worse...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, yet deep mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stretch and compress your spring, adjust the angle, and land with pinpoint accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of relentless gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish it fast – or fail for days. Your skill decides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good vs. Bad Ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One final decision can lead you to triumph... or put your patience and control to the ultimate test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A peaceful, yet merciless experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based jumping. Every platform is carefully crafted. Endless challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER ALL THE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...each with their own theme and hazards, to reach the ultimate reward. Discover hidden lessons, ancient secrets, and perhaps... the meaning of life itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/30da26bf72f79e64c562f948947d042c.poster.avif?t=1771851892\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/30da26bf72f79e64c562f948947d042c.webm?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/30da26bf72f79e64c562f948947d042c.mp4?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Developer's Note:</u></strong>  <br><i>Spring Me Up</i> is inspired <i>by Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing</i> by Pontypants. We consider it a continuation of a genre that, in our opinion, still has far too few entries today - and with this game, we aim to contribute to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/2408fe1cd1b4bd9776584b0ec2829e3a.poster.avif?t=1771851892\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/2408fe1cd1b4bd9776584b0ec2829e3a.webm?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/2408fe1cd1b4bd9776584b0ec2829e3a.mp4?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPRING YOUR WAY UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...through a colossal, punishing world, using nothing but a giant spring strapped to your body. Every jump demands perfect compression, careful angles, and ruthless precision if you want to reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/942cda03c40245f4bd07f419524ab34a.poster.avif?t=1771851892\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/942cda03c40245f4bd07f419524ab34a.webm?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/942cda03c40245f4bd07f419524ab34a.mp4?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...takes you through a vast of punishing levels, filled with diverse environments, tricky platforms, and unexpected surprises. Every jump matters, and the path to the top is full of tension, testing your patience, skill, and self-control. Will you reach the ultimate success, or stumble just short and face a different fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/14ad4874e0a92ccccd203ea6d14de39a.avif?t=1771851892\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras_big/14ad4874e0a92ccccd203ea6d14de39a.avif?t=1771851892 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ENJOY:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deaths, just pain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the constant fear of falling and losing all your progress. Perhaps worse...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, yet deep mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stretch and compress your spring, adjust the angle, and land with pinpoint accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of relentless gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish it fast – or fail for days. Your skill decides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good vs. Bad Ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One final decision can lead you to triumph... or put your patience and control to the ultimate test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A peaceful, yet merciless experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based jumping. Every platform is carefully crafted. Endless challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER ALL THE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...each with their own theme and hazards, to reach the ultimate reward. Discover hidden lessons, ancient secrets, and perhaps... the meaning of life itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/30da26bf72f79e64c562f948947d042c.poster.avif?t=1771851892\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/30da26bf72f79e64c562f948947d042c.webm?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/30da26bf72f79e64c562f948947d042c.mp4?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Developer's Note:</u></strong>  <br><i>Spring Me Up</i> is inspired <i>by Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing</i> by Pontypants. We consider it a continuation of a genre that, in our opinion, still has far too few entries today - and with this game, we aim to contribute to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/2408fe1cd1b4bd9776584b0ec2829e3a.poster.avif?t=1771851892\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/2408fe1cd1b4bd9776584b0ec2829e3a.webm?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/extras/2408fe1cd1b4bd9776584b0ec2829e3a.mp4?t=1771851892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A challenging physics-based 2.5D platformer. Use your spring to bounce and land with precision, navigating tricky platforms and obstacles. Every miscalculation can send you back, testing your skill, patience, and self-control.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/387ebf77ae87055a984eb2119af5a04686735289/header.jpg?t=1771851892", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/4524b948493b45b50a859ba4c2026ea3939f02c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771851892", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218230/4524b948493b45b50a859ba4c2026ea3939f02c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771851892", "website": "https://morepaingames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDITA GTX 970 / AMD RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Di